# Play test of Lantern Spire (CIPlay lantern_spire, in a test world 'CI ...'): a flying island (Height 60 m). Points as
# in its recipe: the flat top (5 m over the island's own water line, r 9 round 0 0); the lantern hut x -2.25..0.75,
# z 1..4, open to the south; the height sign at 3 -3.
island Lantern Spire
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Light in the North
wait 5
# On the top (the player put there: in a world it is built up to from the raft)
at 0 -3
expect height 65
zone summit
expect step 1
read Sign: a flying island
expect step 2
walk 0 -2 to -0.75 0 to -0.75 2.5 h=65.1 below=67
open Sky keeper's chest
expect done
